abstract: >-
  AetherIntent is the thirteenth candidate of the Aether family. It investigates
  whether autonomous agents can execute financially valid transactions that
  violate the human's delegated intent, and whether an independent deterministic
  enforcement layer can prevent that execution. Current status: Phase 0
  (Architectural Hypothesis). Decision: (E) Undetermined (interim).
date-released: 2026-11-21
